{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PackJack blends casual strategy with rogue-like elements, delivering an addictive card-collecting experience. Each turn, you open TCG booster packs, expanding your collection with new cards. However, after each pack, rival collectors challenge you in intense booster battles. Only the most valuable collection will come out on top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pull Rare Cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase that last pack magic! Get lucky and score a mythical pull!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/extras/PackJack-gif-1.gif?t=1745504641\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Change the Odds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate and combine the effects of your collected cards to influence the contents of the next pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/extras/PackJack-gif-2.gif?t=1745504641\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Collectors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who has the ultimate collection? Defeat rivals to climb the leaderboard of the TCG shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/extras/PackJack-gif-3.gif?t=1745504641\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect them all!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your collection with every run! Each new card you unlock is permanently added to your binder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/extras/PackJack-gif-4.gif?t=1745504641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open TCG booster packs and build your collection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically decide which cards to keep or trade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle rivals and become the ultimate collector!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Lucky Cards to unleash powerful combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the odds in your favor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PackJack is a bite-sized, high-replayability roguelike packed with juicy mechanics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601690?t=1745504641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/7b326594d63731446b6e14c420095b39e231f0c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745504641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/f18d2305b9940fc76ae92a06a658a13a4a18a9fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745504641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/f18d2305b9940fc76ae92a06a658a13a4a18a9fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745504641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1745504641\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PackJack blends casual strategy with rogue-like elements, delivering an addictive card-collecting experience. Each turn, you open TCG booster packs, expanding your collection with new cards. However, after each pack, rival collectors challenge you in intense booster battles. Only the most valuable collection will come out on top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pull Rare Cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase that last pack magic! Get lucky and score a mythical pull!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\